      "description": "Watch Doncaster vs Middlesbrough highlights and goals from Carabao on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 25, 2026. The stage was set for a high-stakes encounter as two sides faced off in a pivotal Carabao Cup fixture. On August 25, 2026, the intensity was palpable, with both teams looking to stamp their authority on the game. Breaking the Deadlock The Middlesbrough attack proved too formidable for the Doncaster Rovers defense throughout the first half. The deadlock was finally broken in the 34th minute, as Kyle Joseph slotted a precise right-footed shot into the bottom right corner, courtesy of a well-placed cross from Jeremy Sarmiento . Despite a flurry of late first-half pressure from the hosts, including efforts from Alfie May , the visitors entered the interval with a hard-earned lead. Closing Out the Result The second half saw Middlesbrough manage the game with composure, waiting for the right moment to strike again. Will Lankshear doubled the lead in the 78th minute, clinically finding the back of the net. As the match approached its conclusion, Jeremy Sarmiento added a third with a spectacular strike from outside the box. While Isaac Hutchinson managed to pull one back for Doncaster Rovers in stoppage time, the damage had been done, and the visitors safely navigated their way into the next round."
